// Q-C — Exclusions (DEMO_TENANT_PLAN §8).
// Count of production-excluded results per day, and confirmation that platform
// resources never appear in decisions. Point to make: production and the hub
// are untouched (BR-003, US-07; scenarios S7/S8).
//
// Part 1: production exclusions per day (W9's subscription is Environment=Prod).
traces
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| where customDimensions["pwrsched.event"] == "pwrsched.decision"
| where tostring(customDimensions["pwrsched.result"]) == "production-excluded"
| summarize productionExcluded = count() by bin(timestamp, 1d)
| order by timestamp asc;
//
// Part 2 (run separately): confirm NO platform resource (rg-demo-platform / W11)
// ever appears in a decision record. Expect an empty result.
// traces
// | where timestamp > ago(7d)
// | where customDimensions["pwrsched.event"] == "pwrsched.decision"
// | where tostring(customDimensions["pwrsched.resourceId"]) has "rg-demo-platform"
// | project timestamp, resourceId = tostring(customDimensions["pwrsched.resourceId"])
